          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "测井数据修复业务问题",
          "html": "<p>缺失段人工补值无依据，异常段靠肉眼识别易漏；不同曲线之间的物理一致性难以人工保证。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"缺测曲线修复\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" fill=\"#274746\"><path d=\"M112 258H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">39.7</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"112\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.0</text><path d=\"M112 205.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"210.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">53.0</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"251.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">59.8</text><path d=\"M112 153H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">66.4</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"391\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">119.5</text><path d=\"M112 100.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"105.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">79.7</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"530.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">179.3</text><path d=\"M112 48H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">93.1</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"670\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">239.0</text><path d=\"M112.00 158.36 L114.33 153.94 L116.67 149.53 L119.00 145.13 L121.34 140.76 L123.67 136.43 L126.01 132.14 L128.34 127.91 L130.68 123.74 L133.01 119.63 L135.35 115.61 L137.68 111.67 L140.02 107.83 L142.35 104.09 L144.69 100.46 L147.02 96.94 L149.36 93.55 L151.69 90.30 L154.03 87.17 L156.36 84.20 L158.69 81.37 L161.03 78.70 L163.36 76.19 L165.70 73.85 L168.03 71.68 L170.37 69.68 L172.70 67.87 L175.04 66.23 L177.37 64.79 L179.71 63.53 L182.04 62.46 L184.38 61.59 L186.71 60.92 L189.05 60.44 L191.38 60.16 L193.72 60.08 L196.05 60.2