 175.27 L401.51 174.51 L403.84 165.49 L406.18 158.88 L408.51 158.98 L410.85 142.05 L413.18 148.52 L415.51 133.75 L417.85 149.09 L420.18 133.07 L422.52 138.13 L424.85 130.98 L427.19 122.58 L429.52 119.20 L431.86 117.56 L434.19 110.52 L436.53 91.27 L438.86 98.94 L441.20 97.64 L443.53 86.79 L445.87 96.64 L448.20 83.15 L450.54 126.63 L452.87 127.90 L455.21 127.85 L457.54 126.47 L459.87 125.11 L462.21 114.76 L464.54 118.31 L466.88 105.17 L469.21 95.17 L471.55 90.70 L473.88 97.13 L476.22 87.59 L478.55 87.05 L480.89 81.51 L483.22 93.76 L485.56 82.46 L487.89 80.58 L490.23 72.24 L492.56 71.51 L494.90 59.45 L497.23 79.30 L499.56 59.33 L501.90 59.16 L504.23 66.14 L506.57 72.52 L508.90 59.54 L511.24 48.00 L513.57 76.70 L515.91 60.08 L518.24 70.06 L520.58 64.17 L522.91 63.85 L525.25 63.23 L527.58 60.54 L529.92 73.00 L532.25 60.11 L534.59 61.93 L536.92 67.32 L539.26 63.42 L541.59 73.83 L543.92 63.99 L546.26 78.31 L548.59 86.11 L550.93 73.14 L553.26 74.49 L555.60 74.66 L557.93 77.31 L560.27 89.19 L562.60 95.03 L564.94 103.49 L567.27 88.36 L569.61 94.45 L571.94 107.18 L574.28 94.18 L576.61 126.80 L578.95 127.19 L581.28 121.46 L583.62 111.20 L585.95 139.50 L588.28 132.05 L590.62 142.93 L592.95 143.62 L595.29 148.75 L597.62 159.93 L599.96 141.71 L602.29 172.56 L604.63 170.54 L606.96 169.98 L609.30 175.41 L611.63 187.70 L613.97 166.64 L616.30 180.16 L618.64 194.28 L620.97 199.11 L623.31 203.24 L625.64 208.74 L627.97 206.02 L630.31 211.58 L632.64 207.85 L634.98 223.29 L637.31 214.12 L639.65 228.20 L641.98 233.35 L644.32 234.51 L646.65 241.76 L648.99 243.52 L651.32 242.39 L653.66 235.50 L655.99 233.91 L658.33 244.89 L660.66 245.48 L663.00 240.68 L665.33 252.61 L667.67 258.00 L670.00 253.14 \" stroke=\"#7654b2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"432\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#7654b2\">处理结果</text><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"391\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\">采样序号</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"153\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 153)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">自然伽马 / API</text></g></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>图为默认参数下实际生成的合成输入或预测关系；完整交互及误差由“案例演示”实时计算。</span></div>"
